     8 │ <template>
   > 9 │   <input v-model="value" />
       │                   ^^^^^
    10 │   <input v-model="user.name" />
    11 │   <button @click="value = 'test'">Assign</button>
  
  i A prop belongs to the parent component. Changing it from the child either fails, or changes the parent's data without the parent knowing.
  
  i Emit an event so the parent can change the value, or copy the prop into a local ref() or computed property.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

